<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $220 mln repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $220 mln repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $220 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent.</p>
<p>Interbank call money closed up at 6.8 percent from 5.975 percent at the close Monday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar closed at 0.99982 pesos, down from 0.99985 pesos Monday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
